1.  READ THE README.FIRST FILE FIRST!!!!!

2.  After completing all the steps in the README.FIRST
    file, then you can run install.sh

3.  Pay attention to the requirements when the script
    tells you what you need to have before you begin!
    You *must* have all of the information it requests.

4.  If you have compiled the DNSTools executable and
    you have all of the right information, the script
    should automate the installation and you will have
    no problems.

5.  The script does some basic checking for existing
    files and the like, but it's not exhaustive, so
    don't try to confuse it.

